<span id="S7.T7.4.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S7.T7.4.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.T7.4.9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Prompt infection</span></span>
